WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:07.750
Welcome to Developmental Mathematics, a four-week course that rebuilds arithmetic from the ground up, starting with whole numbers and place value.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:15.750
Every lecture explains one idea at three depths, short, medium, and long, with an AI tutor and adaptive practice right beside it.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:27.750
Stuck on a concept? The tutor is scoped to the exact lecture you're reading. Ask why a rule actually works, and it answers in plain language, step-by-step.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:37.750
Your analytics dashboard tracks mastery across every topic, so you can see what you've learned and where you still need a little more practice.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:51.750
Practice adapts to you. Answer in proper notation with the on-screen math keyboard, fractions, exponents, and signs. Miss one and it eases off, nail it and the difficulty climbs.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:01:01.750
Homework and tests are graded by AI with two-layer authorship detection on every answer. Teach yourself developmental mathematics: read it, ground it, write it.